    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;In an abandoned kingdom scarred by darkness, a broken knight must fight to protect his world.&quot;</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Three Potions</i> is a 2D action-platformer adventure with aggressive fast-paced combat and an engaging storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Three Potions</i>, a knight named Kal awakens to protect the empty kingdom of Heartfall. Evil has been lurking, and Kal must travel far to the east, facing harrowing dangers, and a regretful past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against fearsome warriors, mages, and forces of binding darkness. Uncover the sorrowful history of Heartfall. Discover if it's truly possible to change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautiful Environments and Visual Effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense mission-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenging Boss Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>",
